      {
        "text": "Ice Edge Gu is the advancement of the rank two Ice Blade Gu. The advanced Gu has a tougher body and a sharper edge. In the fight with Tie Dao Ku, she places her palms together and splits them apart to form a blade of pure ice, then dual wields iceblades while retreating under his hand blade assault.",
