          "gu_ice_blade_gu",
          "char_tie_dao_ku"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Against Yan Tu, Bai Ning Bing uses Ice Edge Gu with Ice Crystal Gu, Swirl Gu, and Tornado Gu at once while reforming ice blade storm, multitasking those four Gu before frost breath joins the move.",
